{"4744830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kickin' Elevator", "steam_appid": 4744830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[NOTICE]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was created as part of Byking Inc.'s new employee training program. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not run properly or unexpected issues may occur. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A keyboard and mouse or controller is required to play this game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ PRECAUTIONS BEFORE PLAYING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game contains flashing lights, loud sounds, and horror elements. Players with photosensitive epilepsy or those sensitive to intense content should avoid playing or proceed at their own discretion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>■ DISCLAIMER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game is a work of fiction. All characters, organizations, locations, events, and other elements depicted are fictional and bear no relation to real people, organizations, or events. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The fictional creatures and horror elements depicted in this game are intended solely for horror entertainment. They are not intended to discriminate against or mock any specific illnesses, disabilities, or physical characteristics.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>● Survival Guide</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your survival ultimately depends on your ability to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >① Observe the other passengers closely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >② Kick out anyone you suspect might be a parasite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >③ Proceed to the next floor only when it's safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/ba13cc5baee19e88e16204c3e0c2f1f9.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/ba13cc5baee19e88e16204c3e0c2f1f9.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/ba13cc5baee19e88e16204c3e0c2f1f9.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>① OBSERVE YOUR SURROUNDINGS FOR ANYTHING UNUSUAL OR SUSPICIOUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Determine if your fellow passengers are actually parasites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study their behavior, watch their reflections in the elevator doors and try rattling your package to provoke a reaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/f027857af1b1e59a6348ef1cbd8040b9.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/f027857af1b1e59a6348ef1cbd8040b9.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/f027857af1b1e59a6348ef1cbd8040b9.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>② KICK OUT ANY SUSPICIOUS PASSENGERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/723fcb89928bb6be588aa8483b3a1664.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/723fcb89928bb6be588aa8483b3a1664.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/723fcb89928bb6be588aa8483b3a1664.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone's even slightly suspicious... just kick them out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully kick out a parasite, its distinguishing features will be recorded on the poster after the elevator starts moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned... accidentally kicking a human will result in other passengers unleashing their rage on both you and your package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's game over if the box gets destroyed—so be sure to think before you kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of kicks and dodges to protect your package all the way to delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>③ PROCEED TO THE NEXT FLOOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have kicked out all parasites, you can safely proceed to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if a parasite remains inside when the elevator doors close, you will become lunchmeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and don't be so sure that humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will remain human the whole ride—any passenger could turn into a parasite before you reach the next floor, so watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－－</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[NOTICE]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game was created as part of Byking Inc.'s new employee training program. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><st