pe=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If someone's even slightly suspicious... just kick them out! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully kick out a parasite, its distinguishing features will be recorded on the poster after the elevator starts moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/8bca91ccd93613a39b73e1345c20b848.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be warned... accidentally kicking a human will result in other passengers unleashing their rage on both you and your package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's game over if the box gets destroyed—so be sure to think before you kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/fac1fb05f0d4edb609036aa0794b6871.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of kicks and dodges to protect your package all the way to delivery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>③ PROCEED TO THE NEXT FLOOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have kicked out all parasites, you can safely proceed to the next floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if a parasite remains inside when the elevator doors close, you will become lunchmeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and don't be so sure that humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will remain human the whole ride—any passenger could turn into a parasite before you reach the next floor, so watch out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.poster.avif?t=1787714180\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.webm?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/extras/7eb90c66886f4df010d2398418ee1c88.mp4?t=1787714180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "In this comedy horror game, you're a deliveryman on what should have been just another routine shift. Carry a bulky package to the top floor while watching out for parasitic monsters disguised as humans. If you spot them, kick them out before you become their next victim!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/37f68f6f6845a81ef957ec8c4bbae5af0dfc0762/header.jpg?t=1787714180", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/8c14d98f601c3c9870dbeeaaa530faec3b38d2e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787714180", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4744830/8c14